%%{ c4: container }%%
graph TB
    Customer[Customer<br/>Person]

    subgraph EcommerceSystem {
        WebApp[Web Application<br/>Container<br/>React]
        APIServer[API Server<br/>Container<br/>Node.js]
        ProductDB[Product Database<br/>Container<br/>PostgreSQL]
        OrderDB[Order Database<br/>Container<br/>MongoDB]
        MessageQueue[Message Queue<br/>Container<br/>RabbitMQ]
    }

    EmailService[Email Service<br/>Software System<br/>External]
    PaymentGateway[Payment Gateway<br/>Software System<br/>External]
    ShippingService[Shipping Service<br/>Software System<br/>External]

    Customer -->|Uses| WebApp

    WebApp -->|Makes API calls to| APIServer

    APIServer -->|Reads product info from| ProductDB
    APIServer -->|Stores order information in| OrderDB
    APIServer -->|Enqueues order for processing| MessageQueue

    MessageQueue -->|Triggers| EmailService
    MessageQueue -->|Triggers| PaymentGateway
    MessageQueue -->|Triggers| ShippingService